    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d311-a37">

                <pb facs="0696" n="612" sameAs="frus:frus1886/pg612"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">First court of first instance of the canton
                        Degollado.</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Temosachic</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1886-02-16"><hi rendition="#italic">February</hi> 16,
                        1886</date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>In order to comply with orders from superior authority, dated 15th instant—copy
                    where of transmitted by the political chief of this canton—let the following
                    persons be subpoenaed: Eutiquio Vargas, Santana Munoz, Pablo Trujillo, Julian
                    Vega, Ricardo Varela, Juan Varela, Pablo Miramontes, Tiburcio Jurado, Luis
                    Macias, and Augustin Munoz; this for the purpose of taking their testimony as to
                    the facts that occurred during the action at Teopar, January 11, last. That
                    being concluded, the further necessary orders will be given. Celso Rascon, the
                    first judge of the first instance of this canton has thus decreed, ordered, and
                    affixed his signature in presence of his court witnesses.</p>
                <p>So we certify.</p>
                <closer><signed><list>
                            <item>CELSO RASCON.</item>
                            <item>A. FRANCO. GARCIA.</item>
                            <item>A. B. AGUIREE.</item>
                        </list></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
